{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battlesail</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battlesail</strong> is a turn-based action strategy game set in the <strong>Golden Age of Piracy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey in the Caribbean as an inexperienced captain and become the king of the oceans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game delivers intense tactical combat in exotic locations with a strong historical flavor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden treasures, and search for mysterious places filled with ancient artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes - Campaign, Arenas, Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battlesail features <strong>two main game modes - story campaign and free play</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign - 30+ handcrafted levels in 5 missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arenas - free to play use fully equipped ships in low to heavy battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles - think twice before any turn and squeeze you brain a bit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Character - Captivating story leader</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game begins with choosing your own character - a captain whose destiny is in your hands and who will accompany you throughout the entire campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/a6e4d121353f6b24546269582c0e2f0f.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/a6e4d121353f6b24546269582c0e2f0f.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/a6e4d121353f6b24546269582c0e2f0f.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fleet - 30+ kinds of ships and four battle classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ships differ not only in size - <strong>four distinct size classes</strong>, from small boats to massive warships\u2014but also in purpose. Choose between ships specialized in <strong>speed, offense, defense, or repairs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/baeb8863737106e4a17ba80255a7821f.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/baeb8863737106e4a17ba80255a7821f.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/baeb8863737106e4a17ba80255a7821f.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades - improve your ship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve the hull, armor, firing accuracy, maneuverability, or hire specialized crews that push your ship\u2019s capabilities even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/8c4ee09a86068305931bbc8e8e6bad0b.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/8c4ee09a86068305931bbc8e8e6bad0b.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/8c4ee09a86068305931bbc8e8e6bad0b.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arsenal - 10+cannons and special ammunitions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From small deck-mounted falconets to massive <strong>Long Nine cannons</strong>, floating mines with different effects, and special ammunition including fire<strong>, chain, and explosive shots</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/7b964baac417ab10b81c66066aca3a79.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/7b964baac417ab10b81c66066aca3a79.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/7b964baac417ab10b81c66066aca3a79.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abilities - unlock dozens of abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ship class has its own unique set of abilities: vanish in a cloud of smoke, repair damage with mass healing, protect allies with damage reduction, or unleash devastating weapons of mass destruction like <strong>mortars</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/580ff622a07fab87ae2b315cb58aa807.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/580ff622a07fab87ae2b315cb58aa807.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/580ff622a07fab87ae2b315cb58aa807.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Captains - power to your battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hire captains of varying levels, each granting unique bonuses to your ships and also accompany you in battle with their humor and advice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/c0914a5184acd19be23e364b6a39a5e3.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/c0914a5184acd19be23e364b6a39a5e3.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/c0914a5184acd19be23e364b6a39a5e3.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environment - huge oceans, beautiful landscapes, mystery islands</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In various environments - you will fight not only against your enemies, but you will deal with nature itself - Navigate through huge oceans, dense kelp fields, sharp reefs, sharpened stakes near native villages, treacherous whirlpools, and other natural hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/2d65d8b312990ad020479913a903a54c.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/2d65d8b312990ad020479913a903a54c.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/2d65d8b312990ad020479913a903a54c.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ship Customization - custom sail, emblems, flags</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your fleet the most beautiful on the seas. Spend diamonds to unlock colorful sails, emblems, flags, and other cosmetic upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/9e0821516ee414cdefe8e77aa1b9368d.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/9e0821516ee414cdefe8e77aa1b9368d.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/9e0821516ee414cdefe8e77aa1b9368d.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Treasure Hunt - chests, gold, diamonds, ancient artefacts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level may hide a valuable chest filled with precious gems. You will also collect fragments of ancient maps - once assembled, they lead to <strong>Treasure Islands</strong> hiding artifacts of immense value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/21daeaeb74b520d888f85664d617b603.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/21daeaeb74b520d888f85664d617b603.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/21daeaeb74b520d888f85664d617b603.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based action strategy with deep and highly variable combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning Caribbean setting with huge oceans inspired by the Golden Age of Piracy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two game modes: story campaign and standalone content (arenas, puzzles)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heroic pirate tale full of rises, falls, and triumph</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly original naval battles shaped by ship builds and player strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive ship customization: sails, colors, emblems, flags, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep progression systems: ship sizes, classes, upgrades, abilities, arsenal, captains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but rewarding economy: win battles \u2192 earn gold \u2192 build stronger fleets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental gameplay elements: volcanoes, kelp fields, reefs, whirlpools, deep colour changing oceans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure hunting based on ancient maps and legendary artifacts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3541140?t=1774030837","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/b7f9b656a773be14ed3ae8abd88f1d83ffd3361b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774030837","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/2a99400ea1df998a26827f877eaf29b649df3efc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774030837","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/2a99400ea1df998a26827f877eaf29b649df3efc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774030837","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4278300,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battlesail</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battlesail</strong> is a turn-based action strategy game set in the <strong>Golden Age of Piracy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey in the Caribbean as an inexperienced captain and become the king of the oceans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game delivers intense tactical combat in exotic locations with a strong historical flavor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden treasures, and search for mysterious places filled with ancient artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes - Campaign, Arenas, Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battlesail features <strong>two main game modes - story campaign and free play</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign - 30+ handcrafted levels in 5 missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arenas - free to play use fully equipped ships in low to heavy battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles - think twice before any turn and squeeze you brain a bit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Character - Captivating story leader</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game begins with choosing your own character - a captain whose destiny is in your hands and who will accompany you throughout the entire campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/a6e4d121353f6b24546269582c0e2f0f.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/a6e4d121353f6b24546269582c0e2f0f.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/a6e4d121353f6b24546269582c0e2f0f.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fleet - 30+ kinds of ships and four battle classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ships differ not only in size - <strong>four distinct size classes</strong>, from small boats to massive warships\u2014but also in purpose. Choose between ships specialized in <strong>speed, offense, defense, or repairs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/baeb8863737106e4a17ba80255a7821f.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/baeb8863737106e4a17ba80255a7821f.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/baeb8863737106e4a17ba80255a7821f.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades - improve your ship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve the hull, armor, firing accuracy, maneuverability, or hire specialized crews that push your ship\u2019s capabilities even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/8c4ee09a86068305931bbc8e8e6bad0b.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/8c4ee09a86068305931bbc8e8e6bad0b.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/8c4ee09a86068305931bbc8e8e6bad0b.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arsenal - 10+cannons and special ammunitions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From small deck-mounted falconets to massive <strong>Long Nine cannons</strong>, floating mines with different effects, and special ammunition including fire<strong>, chain, and explosive shots</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/7b964baac417ab10b81c66066aca3a79.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/7b964baac417ab10b81c66066aca3a79.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/7b964baac417ab10b81c66066aca3a79.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abilities - unlock dozens of abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ship class has its own unique set of abilities: vanish in a cloud of smoke, repair damage with mass healing, protect allies with damage reduction, or unleash devastating weapons of mass destruction like <strong>mortars</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/580ff622a07fab87ae2b315cb58aa807.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/580ff622a07fab87ae2b315cb58aa807.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/580ff622a07fab87ae2b315cb58aa807.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Captains - power to your battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hire captains of varying levels, each granting unique bonuses to your ships and also accompany you in battle with their humor and advice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/c0914a5184acd19be23e364b6a39a5e3.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/c0914a5184acd19be23e364b6a39a5e3.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/c0914a5184acd19be23e364b6a39a5e3.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environment - huge oceans, beautiful landscapes, mystery islands</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In various environments - you will fight not only against your enemies, but you will deal with nature itself - Navigate through huge oceans, dense kelp fields, sharp reefs, sharpened stakes near native villages, treacherous whirlpools, and other natural hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/2d65d8b312990ad020479913a903a54c.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/2d65d8b312990ad020479913a903a54c.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/2d65d8b312990ad020479913a903a54c.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ship Customization - custom sail, emblems, flags</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your fleet the most beautiful on the seas. Spend diamonds to unlock colorful sails, emblems, flags, and other cosmetic upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/9e0821516ee414cdefe8e77aa1b9368d.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/9e0821516ee414cdefe8e77aa1b9368d.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/9e0821516ee414cdefe8e77aa1b9368d.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Treasure Hunt - chests, gold, diamonds, ancient artefacts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level may hide a valuable chest filled with precious gems. You will also collect fragments of ancient maps - once assembled, they lead to <strong>Treasure Islands</strong> hiding artifacts of immense value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/21daeaeb74b520d888f85664d617b603.poster.avif?t=1774030837\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/21daeaeb74b520d888f85664d617b603.webm?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/21daeaeb74b520d888f85664d617b603.mp4?t=1774030837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based action strategy with deep and highly variable combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning Caribbean setting with huge oceans inspired by the Golden Age of Piracy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two game modes: story campaign and standalone content (arenas, puzzles)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heroic pirate tale full of rises, falls, and triumph</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly original naval battles shaped by ship builds and player strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive ship customization: sails, colors, emblems, flags, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep progression systems: ship sizes, classes, upgrades, abilities, arsenal, captains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but rewarding economy: win battles \u2192 earn gold \u2192 build stronger fleets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental gameplay elements: volcanoes, kelp fields, reefs, whirlpools, deep colour changing oceans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure hunting based on ancient maps and legendary artifacts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["rendeo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/d77bb560b320ee0d3636af71ee897f431f5bb56a/header.jpg?t=1774030837","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/354